    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Artificial Intelligence PSIKE is a 2D indie platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action: Fast and beautiful combo attacks and effects will take you into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/d042b04e73be12ea6918fa4c3e2f97e2.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/eb32287eba12fdc70c02136531ca8f75.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/6ed8c9ad7f37e30d8cee8f5aef4d9dca.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphical experience: The epic story that penetrates the game can be experienced as a visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/37b6ab7f111994006abc2a5ffa411cdc.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/89c4d9a6a6cbe2b97e6f0a3f2c554ff1.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/4e0eda0d1913bb5036dc067c32359101.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, artificial intelligence with ego is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a result, mankind is facing a new leap forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, humanity is starting to be increasingly controlled by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day. PSIKE, an artificial intelligence that will save mankind, is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSIKE, an artificial intelligence who wants to become a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex, a man full of disbelief in artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Guardians of the Round Table who stand in the way of PSIKE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wheel of fortune begins to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.poster.avif?t=1747490773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.webm?t=1747490773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.mp4?t=1747490773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Artificial Intelligence PSIKE is a 2D indie platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action: Fast and beautiful combo attacks and effects will take you into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/d042b04e73be12ea6918fa4c3e2f97e2.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/eb32287eba12fdc70c02136531ca8f75.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/6ed8c9ad7f37e30d8cee8f5aef4d9dca.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphical experience: The epic story that penetrates the game can be experienced as a visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/37b6ab7f111994006abc2a5ffa411cdc.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/89c4d9a6a6cbe2b97e6f0a3f2c554ff1.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/4e0eda0d1913bb5036dc067c32359101.avif?t=1747490773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, artificial intelligence with ego is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a result, mankind is facing a new leap forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, humanity is starting to be increasingly controlled by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day. PSIKE, an artificial intelligence that will save mankind, is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSIKE, an artificial intelligence who wants to become a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex, a man full of disbelief in artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Guardians of the Round Table who stand in the way of PSIKE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wheel of fortune begins to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.poster.avif?t=1747490773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.webm?t=1747490773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/20a71d64c870f4a2b4cf050b3bf8e6f3.mp4?t=1747490773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
